./logs/iter_001_idea_02_explorer_01.stdout.log:167:For necessity, first fix the intended quantifier. If process-specific, record the counterexample above and abandon necessity of uniform \(\gamma\). If class-uniform/minimax, try a two-process indistinguishability lower bound where delayed positive-payoff events hide which of two separated quotes is better.
