./iterations/iter_001/idea_01/idea.md:6:Verify the solver's sparse vanishing-spike refutation line by line: beta(h)=1 via action a=0 at spike times, the best fixed comparator has expected payoff at most 1 for every horizon, and the continuum maximum exists. Then try to strengthen it to a family with beta=1 and regret bounded by any prescribed sublinear envelope.
