./logs/iter_001_idea_02_explorer_01_critic_01.stderr.log:1019:- Lukas Zierahn, Dirk van der Hoeven, Tal Lancewicki, Aviv Rosenberg, Nicolò Cesa-Bianchi. “A Unified Analysis of Nonstochastic Delayed Feedback for Combinatorial Semi-Bandits, Linear Bandits, and MDPs.” JMLR 26(104):1-60, 2025; earlier COLT 2023 version. https://www.jmlr.org/papers/v26/24-0496.html. Background for modern delayed-feedback analysis.
