./logs/iter_001_idea_03_explorer_02.stdout.log:30:\Delta_T(H).
./logs/iter_001_idea_03_explorer_02.stdout.log:33:Thus if some `H_T` satisfies `H_T log T = o(T)` and `Delta_T(H_T)=o(T)`, then choosing for instance `K=T` gives sublinear regret.
