./logs/iter_001_idea_01_explorer_01_critic_01.stderr.log:1046:./iterations/iter_001/idea_01/explorer_02.md:61:For any eventually positive nondecreasing envelope \(q(T)=o(T)\), one can build a process with \(\beta(h)=1\) for all \(h\) and an always-zero learner satisfying \(R(T)\le q(T)/2\) for all sufficiently large \(T\).
