./logs/iter_001_idea_01_explorer_01_critic_02.stderr.log:926:- **Worth pursuing:** The \(\beta(h)=1\) argument via \(a=0\) is sound. The condition is unweighted, and zero-payoff quotes can force arbitrarily long finite hitting times.
